TEXT -128 48 Left 5 ;Earth fault primary side
TEXT 216 216 Left 2 ;Due to the earth fault\nthe current flows in a circle \nbetween primary and secondary side\nof the transformer.\nThis can be shown best by setting\nthe secondary voltage same as the primary\nvoltage and set the transformer model\nto 9limbs core or 3x1 core (three \nper phase transformer units)\nTherefore low resistive grounding at both sides of a \nYy transformer is not a good idea
